        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Simultaneous and Consecutive Interpretation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SIMULTANEOUS INTERPRETATION (SI):\n  Interpreter works in real time, with ~2-5 second lag\n  behind the speaker. The speaker never stops."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-INTERPRETATION.md#004",
      "path": [
        "07-INTERPRETATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:translation:07-interpretation, git-history:translation:07-interpretation]",
