        "title": "Simultaneous and Consecutive Interpretation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Daniel Gile (*Basic Concepts and Models for Interpreter and Translator Training*, 1995) provides a cognitive load model for simultaneous interpretation:"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-INTERPRETATION.md#019",
      "path": [
        "07-INTERPRETATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
