        "title": "Simultaneous and Consecutive Interpretation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nGILE'S EFFORT MODEL FOR SIMULTANEOUS INTERPRETATION\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-INTERPRETATION.md#020",
      "path": [
        "07-INTERPRETATION.md"
      ],
