        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Simultaneous and Consecutive Interpretation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TOTAL PROCESSING CAPACITY\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │  L (Listening and Analysis Effort)                     │\n  │  + M (Memory Effort — working memory management)       │\n  │  + P (Production Effort)                               │\n  │  + C (Coordination Effort — coordinating the above)    │\n  │  ≤ Available Processing Capacity                       │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-INTERPRETATION.md#021",
      "path": [
        "07-INTERPRETATION.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:translation:07-interpretation, git-history:translation:07-interpretation]",
