        "title": "Simultaneous and Consecutive Interpretation",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The International Military Tribunal at Nuremberg (1945-46) was the first major deployment of simultaneous interpretation. Four working languages: English, French, Russian, German."
    },
    {
      "id": "07-INTERPRETATION.md#033",
      "path": [
